# Whipped Cottage Cheese

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 cup [cottage cheese]{ ing="cottage-cheese" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }
- [ ] 1 small [garlic clove]{ ing="garlic-clove" } (or 1/4 tsp garlic powder)
- [ ] [Salt and black pepper]{ ing="salt-and-black-pepper" }, to taste

## Recipe

1. Blend all ingredients until completely smooth, about 1–2 minutes
1. Taste and adjust lemon, garlic, and salt
1. Transfer to a bowl and top as desired

## Notes

### Topping Ideas

- Olive oil + red pepper flakes + fresh herbs (parsley, chives)
- Everything bagel seasoning
- Roasted tomatoes or sun-dried tomatoes
- Za’atar + olive oil
- Honey + walnuts (sweet direction)

### Uses

- Dip for vegetables, pita, or crackers — works as a hummus alternative
- Spread on toast
- Base for a savory bowl (see [Cottage Cheese Savory Bowl](./cottage_cheese_savory_bowl.html))
- Dolloped onto shakshuka or grain bowls
